## Added
* Redstone-over-radio calculation relay
  * A simple RoR component that receives signals and uses them as variables in mathematical expressions
  * Allows basic automated calculation without needing an AUTOCAL

## Changed
* The press and anvil recipes for turning ingots into plates now use autogen, meaning that plates from other mod materials can now be made, if they exist
* RoR panels can now receive non-integer number signals, in which case the numer is rounded to the nearest integer

## Fixed
* Fixed panzerschreck reload taking 1.5 seconds longer than intended
* Fixed an issue where empty ore dictionary names could cause recipes with nonexistant ingredients to be generated